      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T14:17:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, this approach is used to generate the chg_chips array used in the EC codebase. With the OCPC config, it is also useful to connect the charger with the port. Once we upstream the drivers to Zephyr, I think the chargers should be added to DTS as devices on the I2C bus like you said.",
