      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T21:29:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the drivers in the legacy code still rely in the I2C bus enumeration, we need to the devicetree entries to be associated with the \"named-i2c-port\" instead of the Zephyr I2C bus.\n\nAs Dawid notes, once the driver moves upstream, then the USB-C related chip will be added directly onto the I2C bus, and the USB-C port will just contain phandles to the correct USB-C chip.",
